egoe UI Emoji', 'Segoe UI Symbol';font-size:18px;font-weight:400;line-heigh=
t:29px;text-align:left;"><p style=3D"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0"></p><p s=
tyle=3D"margin:10px 0">It has been a while since I update this and this not=
e above inspired me.  There are a lot of ways to cut this down. </p><p styl=
e=3D"margin:10px 0">Anyhow, also inspired by our member Timothee who mined =
the whole conversation going back months in the Savings Hacks channel.  Her=
e is a summary of many of the takeaways from Savings Hacks channel:</p><ol>=
<li><p style=3D"margin:10px 0">Track every expense for a month or two, then=
 build a budget around what you actually spend.</p></li><li><p style=3D"mar=
gin:10px 0">Cancel any subscription you don=E2=80=99t regularly use (gym, s=
treaming, software, etc.).</p></li><li><p style=3D"margin:10px 0">Cook meal=
s at home and brew your own coffee instead of dining out or cafe runs.</p><=
/li><li><p style=3D"margin:10px 0">Comparison-shop insurance and bundle int=
ernet, cable, and phone services to lower monthly bills.</p></li><li><p sty=
le=3D"margin:10px 0">Always ask for =E2=80=93 or hunt down =E2=80=93 studen=
t, senior, or membership discounts before paying.</p></li><li><p style=3D"m=
argin:10px 0">Pay off high-interest debt first; refinance whenever you can =
lock in a lower rate.</p></li><li><p style=3D"margin:10px 0">Make your home=
 more efficient (seal drafts, install programmable thermostats) and conside=
r downsizing or getting a roommate.</p></li><li><p style=3D"margin:10px 0">=
Set up automatic transfers so money moves into savings or investments the m=
oment you=E2=80=99re paid.</p></li><li><p style=3D"margin:10px 0">Skip luxu=
ry brands and pricey vacations if =E2=80=9Cstatus=E2=80=9D isn=E2=80=99t pa=
rt of your real goals.</p></li><li><p style=3D"margin:10px 0">Limit credit-=
card swipes to fixed bills (utilities, phone, basic groceries) to avoid ove=
rspending.</p></li><li><p style=3D"margin:10px 0">Build a budget quickly: d=
ownload the last 3 months of bank data, categorize every transaction, and t=
otal the columns.</p></li><li><p style=3D"margin:10px 0">Judge entertainmen=
t by =E2=80=9Chours per dollar=E2=80=9D; board games and discounted video g=
ames beat most nights out.</p></li><li><p style=3D"margin:10px 0">Enjoy che=
ap drinks: tall cans + mini liquor bottles, or learn to brew your own beer.=
</p></li><li><p style=3D"margin:10px 0">Choose low-cost hobbies (reading, D=
IY projects) and skip frequent trips or weekend getaways.</p></li><li><p st=
yle=3D"margin:10px 0">Let clearance stickers guide grocery choices and comp=
are cost per pound, not package size.</p></li><li><p style=3D"margin:10px 0=
">Buy kids=E2=80=99 toys second-hand (Marketplace, consignment shops) at ro=
ughly 80 % off retail.</p></li><li><p style=3D"margin:10px 0">Store 80 % of=
 kids=E2=80=99 toys away and rotate them monthly so everything feels =E2=80=
=9Cnew=E2=80=9D without buying more.</p></li><li><p style=3D"margin:10px 0"=
>Repair rather than replace big-ticket items (e.g., swap bearings in a wash=
er, revive a thrift-store vacuum).</p></li><li><p style=3D"margin:10px 0">S=
hare streaming-service logins (where terms allow) and accept single-screen =
limits to cut monthly costs.</p></li></ol><p style=3D"margin:10px 0"></p><p=
></p></div></td></tr>
